{"title":"Add slugify(input: string): string export with tests","body":"Adds a `slugify` helper that converts a string into a lowercase, hyphen-separated slug, closing issue #1.

- Added `slugify` export in `src/index.ts` that lowercases, trims, replaces non-alphanumeric runs with hyphens, and strips leading/trailing hyphens.
- Added a test in `src/index.test.ts` verifying `slugify("Hello, World!")` returns `"hello-world"`."}

